### HuruDrive API Test File
### Use with VS Code REST Client extension
### Install: https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=humao.rest-client

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = 

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Get All Vehicles
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vehicles

### Get Vehicles by Location
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vehicles?location=Nairobi

### Get Single Vehicle
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vehicles/bfa2e852-388c-48cb-9f4d-c54b5c2d8049

### Register User
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "phone": "0712345678",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login (Save token from response)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@hurudrive.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Get Current User (Replace token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create Booking (Replace token and vehicleId)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": "bfa2e852-388c-48cb-9f4d-c54b5c2d8049",
  "pickupLocation": "Nairobi CBD",
  "returnLocation": "Nairobi CBD",
  "pickupAt": "2024-01-25T10:00:00Z",
  "returnAt": "2024-01-28T10:00:00Z"
}

### Process Payment (Replace token and bookingId)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": "713c8b76-c449-4a3d-9284-e39f66568e3b",
  "provider": "mpesa",
  "amount": 7875
}

### Get User Bookings (Replace token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/user/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get User Stats (Replace token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/user/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get User Payments (Replace token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/user/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Admin Bookings (Admin token required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Admin Stats (Admin token required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Admin Feedback (Admin token required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/feedback
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
